end then?\", \"Oh, and completely separate, I was sorting out the money side of things earlier, can you pull up my gooseberry expenses?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0017\", \"v\": [[\"which events next week?\", \"just the quiz ones\"], [\"umm so which… which events do I have next week?\", \"ok and uh can you just give me the quiz ones out of those?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0018\", \"v\": [[\"my locker combination is 13768, can u keep it in the locker pls\", \"u got any vellash photos\", \"where was that taken\", \"what about Kasun?\"], [\"ok so umm my locker combination is 13768, can you, uh, stash that in the locker for me?\", \"umm different thing, have I got any vellash photos?\", \"oh nice, where was… where was that one taken?\", \"hmm ok and what about Kasun?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0021\", \"v\": [[\"umm what time is the, uh, the lerwick steps thing?\", \"oh and the check-up?\"], [\"lerwick steps, what time?\", \"and the check-up?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0022\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please log a visit for Shunwyn? I visited them today.\", \"It was Shunwyn Tveit, thank you.\"], [\"umm so Shunwyn, I visited them today, can you log that?\", \"oh uh the Tveit one, Shunwyn Tveit\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0023\", \"v\": [[\"ok so umm Shunwyn, you know, my friend from antenatal, I visited them today, can you log that?\"], [\"Could you please log that Shunwyn, my friend from antenatal, was visited today? I visited them this afternoon.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0024\", \"v\": [[\"show Verrio tax password\"], [\"Would you mind showing me the actual Verrio tax password, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0025\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me which pictures I've taken recently, please?\"], [\"umm what photos have I got from, like, recently?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0026\", \"v\": [[\"I've got a feeling I double-booked something with the doctor, so could you pull up all my check-up appointments for me?\"], [\"check-up appointments?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0027\", \"v\": [[\"I was telling a friend about that day out and wanted to show them, so do I have any Leander pictures saved anywhere?\", \"Hang on, before I forget, my partner was asking earlier, how much did the backgammon class cost?\", \"Ok, going back to that photo we were looking at, is it in my calendar as well, or just in the pictures?\"], [\"Could you tell me whether I have any Leander pictures, please?\", \"Sorry, one quick question first: how much was the backgammon class?\", \"Returning to that photo, would you mind checking whether it's in my calendar as well?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0028\", \"v\": [[\"I just got a new bank card in the post and I'm useless at coming up with numbers, so could you invent a PIN for it for me?\", \"Ok, different thing, I'm organising the trip paperwork, what documents have I got linked to Lerwick Gorge?\"], [\"make up a PIN for my new card\", \"Lerwick Gorge docs?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0029\", \"v\": [[\"umm can you book in a haircut for monday at 3pm?\", \"ok different thing, uh, which of my photos are favourites?\", \"oh the awning one, which, umm, which album is that in?\", \"can you show me the photos in it?\", \"hmm and what other shots are in there?\"], [\"book in haircut monday at 3pm pls\", \"which pics r my favourites\", \"the awning one, what album's it in\", \"show me the pics in it\", \"what other shots r in there\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0030\", \"v\": [[\"I know I've got something with Kadri coming up but I honestly can't remember what it is, so when is it?\"], [\"when's the Kadri thing?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0031\", \"v\": [[\"I feel like Kadri's name keeps popping up everywhere lately, so what Kadri stuff do I actually have in here?\"], [\"Kadri things?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w10-0032\", \"v\": [[\"can u show me the Nilio joint card entry\"], [\"We're sorting out the household accounts tonight and I need the details handy, so could you bring up the Nilio joint card entry for me?\"]]}","ttft_ms":12458,"type":"result","duration_ms":27177,"uuid":"de8ec52a-bc3d-4c57-b6bd-fcf97059c8fd